    <h1>Olist Seller Performance &amp; SLA Analytics</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">Olist is a Brazilian marketplace where independent sellers fulfill orders directly. I treated sellers as vendors, delivery estimates as SLA commitments, and late deliveries as compliance violations — then ranked them the way a supply chain team does in a live operation.</p>

